profile-viewer.js
-----------------

Flame graph renderer from jl-profile.js (https://github.com/pfitzseb/jl-profile.js),
version 0.4.1, commit 44fe7c33bc23a8e4cdb3b67674994fe2564245bf -- the version
julia-vscode's `libs/jl-profile` submodule pins. Built from its `profile-viewer.ts`:

    npx esbuild profile-viewer.ts --format=esm --target=es2020 --outfile=profile-viewer.js

